<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez to issue New World warrants.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez to issue New World warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said it intended to issue 60 million American-style call warrants on shares of New World Development Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$34.425	  PREMIUM     9.50 percent</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.99225	 GEARING     4.1 times</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	07.Oct.97	  ISSUE DATE  To be announced</p>
<p> LISTING	   Hong Kong	  BOARD LOT   10,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	HK$40.50</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
